        "80d3ee7d-e860-4a9c-8b84-2c5508cdf136": {
          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": true,
            "title": "Why is Dust escaping from the vacuum?",
            "text": "<p>This can be caused by:<br/><br/>1. Dust bag or dust bag chamber cover is not installed correctly. Check the dust bag or dust bag chamber cover for correct installation and ensure they are snapped firmly in place.<br/>2. HEPA exhaust filter is installed incorrectly. Check exhaust filter for correct installation. <br/>3. The dust bag is worn or broken. Check and replace the dust bag. <br/>4. Foam filter or HEPA exhaust filter is worn or broken. Check and replace the foam filter or the HEPA exhaust filter.</p>",
            "button_1_style": "black",
            "button_1_text": "",
            "button_1_url": "",
